{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5980932033004b1dda83155dc8829566ea84800f8f8e395219b104048a36bfdd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"angleschina/angles-cli@53cf51b702e4 snapshot 8818c2194b628043","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_277bc4efc9f7ef9f3c65785d793aa014b0323ad528622028e073fbd85c50b53f","slc_8c91870aebf3b98525b477355f1525f182d3e8919d8a1d349097350fcf0dcd8d","slc_acc9a30ea099a52b22c33a8a1420539a36ea0032818574e76c859dc87c709732","slc_b0688447629332c71112dd28cd2661a365f46b8e2b19ba0ce4eaffd4258f1bb8"],"source_ids":["src_508bfa814b3554a894cc8f9125912e4b","src_aeaab04e90e45dc8b5b3007da6ae6ef3"],"text":"The 13 KB instructions.txt system-prompt template uses handlebars-style {{variable}} injection for config values, persona, and architecture, and directs the agent to emit operation plans with fixed verbs before non-trivial tasks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_96d7777be6e1d4b437721b14c8e7fe3f84ad6bc56be5017ef3269c91c739fe41","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"angleschina/angles-cli@53cf51b702e4 snapshot 8818c2194b628043","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_277bc4efc9f7ef9f3c65785d793aa014b0323ad528622028e073fbd85c50b53f"],"source_ids":["src_aeaab04e90e45dc8b5b3007da6ae6ef3"],"text":"The codebase is organized into Rust modules including main.rs (entry/routing), cli.rs, config.rs, provider.rs, gateway.rs, instructions.rs, api.rs, search.rs, server.rs, and tools.rs, plus instructions.txt, providers.toml, and docs/.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b6fc85dcc26bb20d936a881ee7d164ce4beef12e2b683f6c8008e14e2fdc4c92","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"angleschina/angles-cli@53cf51b702e4 snapshot 8818c2194b628043","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7618241be08bfdff6851d4fb7c6ea1776c5a3d36acf3903fd8bd7f2ec0504ba6","slc_b1d3342cea9f35e0174dbc018784f8faf959377f8963d1b395b7cd27c47e0d9a"],"source_ids":["src_aeaab04e90e45dc8b5b3007da6ae6ef3"],"text":"A provider registry (provider.rs plus providers.toml) maps 11 providers to three wire protocols — OpenAI Chat Completions, Anthropic Messages, or Gemini Native — normalizing streaming and tool calls so the rest of the code is provider-agnostic.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b7f6125e64be730659260eee52527b4f498dce27912283e45836b4ac8f331e44","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"angleschina/angles-cli@53cf51b702e4 snapshot 8818c2194b628043","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_40f09c2d1586e36f84084bcb1a8dafb8061921cd7af2bccabc67138adc1be8ec","slc_f4db5a63f813a41e417db6a54a76d1e3292055cbff2a1acb8008ae69fb8522a4"],"source_ids":["src_623a2a1bd1c654bda1a8584fb805b1ee"],"text":"Approval policy is configurable to untrusted, on-request, or never, controlling whether tool calls require user confirmation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d2dbc13f5fe6943e4a298d68ed6d0e8738d4d7469348c0164edfa72109819ae6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"angleschina/angles-cli@53cf51b702e4 snapshot 8818c2194b628043","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0f08d6909c4a301a8e8f82a0d0a5a8cbcf792255b93cdf24290f36f6be430e56"],"source_ids":["src_aeaab04e90e45dc8b5b3007da6ae6ef3"],"text":"The conversation loop lives in api.rs, an OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini client with streaming and a tool-calling loop that resolves angles-* commands to implementations in tools.rs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4351f93141a34092bdfa567d49d41262"}
